  "answer": "The apertium-anaphora module increased the accuracy of anaphor translation for Spanish–English by 25 percentage points, from 29.2% to 54.2%. However, for Catalan–Italian, it resulted in a slight decrease in accuracy, from 83.3% to 75.0% [1].",
